# Input for `make test` (sdk/tools/inputscript.py). Time 0 = the program was started.
# The same play as the assembly template's (sdk/templates/game/test.script).
# The title screen
1000 shot
# Space starts; hold Right: the player walks along the top corridor over two gems
+200 key space 100
+500 key right 1500
+1600 shot
# then Down into the corridor below (the turn helper lines the player up)
+100 key down 600
+700 shot
# a click on the playfield: the player walks towards the pointer
# (the window's content starts at screen 160, 91)
+200 move 200 245
+100 click
+1500 shot
# Esc: back to the title (the frame counts are printed: "GEMRUN: N frames, ...")
+200 {esc}
+700 shot
